[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_3wbki"]
script = ExtResource("41")
name = "BeefStarchJello"
role = "Owner, Director, Art Director, Voice Actor, Writer, Animator, Artist"
description = "“She Beef on my Starch till I Jello. [img=64x64]res://assets/menus/console/credits/customemojis/GorillaDog.png[/img]”

Co-Creator of Happy Bunnies. Cutscene Animator, Concept Artist, Animator.

[u]      Art/Overall     [/u]

The Collector Voice Acting & Writing, 3D Prop Designer, Title Screen Intro & Assets, Bootup Warning assets, Volume Slider, Game design, Discord VC Resident, Fishsticks Servant. 

[u]Cabinet of Novelties Shop[/u]
Soulroom Console Prop Design, Unown List Reference, Support Beam Design, Cash Register Design, \"Shop or Talk\" Sign Design, Soultoken Design, Console UI Designs, Portrait Frame Design, Cartridge Case Design, Notepad Design, Shop animation concepts, Console Options Portraits, Options menu art assets, register lighting, results screen concept, Soultoken receive screen, Cartridge Case coming down/up animations, shop ui assets and concept.

[u]Kollectadex[/u] 
UI Design & Concept, each entry writing.

[u]Console[/u]
UI design, every menu's design, bootup concept and 2D assets, options menu tooltip writing + writing implementation.

[u]Safety Lullaby[/u]
Intro Cutscene Storyboard & Animation, Hypno Sprite Animations, Laugh + Walk Animation cleanup & finalization, song background, gameover ingame scene transition into closeup, Pendulum Sprite & Animation.

[u]Monochrome[/u]
Lost Silver Week writing & planning, Gold Voice Actor Storyboard Revision, Gold Phase 1 Sprites, Celebi Sprites, \"No More\" Transition Animation, Gold Phase 2 Concepts & Animation, Blood Singing Sprites, Mid-Song Cutscene storyboard, Mid-Song Cutscene circling Unowns Animation, Unown Alphabet animations, Jumpscare Return Cleanup, Unown list words. 

[u]Chimera[/u]
Writing, Storyboard, Chimera Hex Maniac Voice Actor, Hex design Concept Art, Serena FNF-Styled Sprites, Photo-taking closeups, Serena Intro Animation, art style transition animation, house blueprint & design, game design ideation, Chimera poses reference video, Chimera poses timing editing, all of Chimera 3D camera movements, First pause assets.

[u]      Programming      [/u]

Warning scene, added social links & credit details to credits, cleaned up implemented voicelines & ingame writing, Monochrome Jar positioning, shop camera repositioning and animations, monojar fix idea heh. Credits management and writing.

[u]Safety Lullaby[/u]
Walking animation fix & addition & timing fixes, shader over screen from pendulum, text coloring, red lighting glow when emphasizing a lyric, color to some words, sizing and other issues.

[u]Monochrome[/u]
Changed intro timings, unown eyes at the start recolored, editing unown word list, chart velocities, added John Monochrome as of community voting.

[u]Chimera[/u]
Full overhaul of visuals & cinematic sequences, post-optimization lighting, asset implementation, camera paths touched up, Chimera Hex positions and animations, broken camera lighting flicker & falling sprite implementation with transition, light transition fade out at the end, sky visual fix, script for taking photo text and heartbeat, sound effect patching/changes, Implemented SFX for running, "
socials_link = "https://x.com/beefstarchjello"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://c3kvjgv8wyyjg"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_1pg6q"]
script = ExtResource("41")
name = "anniebuue"
role = "Owner, Director, Programmer, Rubicon Engine Lead Co-creator and Programmer"
description = "[center][font_size=32]Oshis: 
Gigi Murin, Cecilia Immergreen, Ninomae Ina'nis,
Dokibird, Mint Fantôme[/font_size]
👧/🍵/🐙/🏆/👻✨
[/center]

\"hello everygrams 😛😛😛😛😛😛\"

[u]Safety Lullaby[/u]
[left]
[u]Pendulum[/u]
[ul]
[u]Input[/u] - Made pendulum dependent on time (similar to how notes are judged) instead of rotation
[u]Rotation Math[/u] - Made and implemented extremely complicated math to make it feel more weighty
[u]Graphics[/u] - Programmed the animations according to Beef's concepts
[/ul]

[u]Pause Menu[/u]
[ul]
[u]Layout[/u] - Made the entire GAME-ACCURATE menu for Safety Lullaby and other Kanto-dervied songs!
[/ul]

[u]Cutscenes[/u]
[ul]
[u]Starting[/u] - Laid out the entire cutscene along with legole0
[u]Death[/u] - Made the original death scene programatically on the Karu Kause build, which was referenced here.
[/ul]
[/left]

[u]Monochrome[/u]
[left]
[u]Layout[/u]
[ul]
[u]Scene[/u] - Laid out the entire initial basic scene, which was expanded on later.
[u]Characters[/u] - Imported the initial Gold P1 and P2 sprites
[u]Noteskin[/u] - Implemented Monochrome's unique noteskin.
[/ul]

[u]Typing Challenge[/u]
[ul]
[u]Graphics[/u] - Implemented Celebi and Unown animations, partially rendered via gdanimate, partially in-engine
[u]Logic[/u] - Made all of the initial logic for the mechanic.
[/ul]

[u]Pause Menu[/u]
[ul]
[u]Layout[/u] - Made the entire GAME-ACCURATE menu for Monochrome and other Johto-dervied songs! Could you tell I copied this?
[/ul]
[/left]

[u]Chimera[/u]
[left]
[u]Mechanics[/u]
[ul]
[u]Heartbeat[/u] - Reworked the visuals to resemble Rhythm Doctor
[/ul]

[u]Pause Menu[/u]
[ul]
[u]Kalos[/u] - Made the entire GAME-ACCURATE (hopefully) menu for Chimera and other Kalos-dervied songs!
[u]Chimera[/u] - Yes, I also made THAT menu almost entirely myself too (The rain was a real recording from my house LOL). Felt a little shiver down your spine? :P
[/ul]
[/left]

[u]Rubicon Engine[/u] (made alongside legole0)
[left]
[ul]
[u]AnimationPlayer-based songs[/u] - Instead of songs working in events, we use something similar to a video editor timeline to create our songs, allowing even the most non-programmery of people (BEEF) to adjust specific details of songs to their liking!
[u]Note System[/u] - It's your standard note system (reworked from HoloFunk), but reversible! Thank you my dear firubii for your awesome base!
[u]Grading System[/u] - Highest combo and accuracy are considered in score! Score actually matters now!? :O
[/ul]
[left]

[u]Game-wide[/u]
[left]
[ul]
[u]Settings[/u] - Initial settings menu and implementation of settings. Do they work fine?
[u]Save Data[/u] - Made the final implementation of save data. Good luck messing with THAT. (It's still easy, just not AS easy :P)
[u]Anti-mash[/u] - Implemented the anti-mash system for Lullaby. Good luck mashing through those songs! I have a personal vendetta against those who do
[u]Loading Screens[/u] - Loading screens! That really work! And are functional! And have hella aura! Begone, (Not Responding)! (Unless one of our programmers messed up somewhere)
[u]FPS Overlay[/u] - See your FPS! Try it! Press F3 right now! :)
[/ul]
[/left]

[u]Baby Mode[/u]
[left]
[ul]
[u]AI[/u] - NO, not like GENERATIVE AI or any chatbots, but the intelligence of the Collector behind the mechanics.
[u]Voicelines[/u] - Also implemented the voicelines for said mode.
[/ul]
[/left]

[u]Miscellaneous[/u]
[left]
[ul]
[u]Credits Scroll[/u] - I made almost that entire thing! (With a few pointers from a few people, of course)
[u]Gigi[/u] - Murin in the Collector's Shop. real important business here
[u]Baby Beef[/u] - Lowkey babysat Beef while she was learning how to work the editor and program Please End My Suffering.
[u]Directorial Duties[/u] - Heavily revamped and reorganized the programming team. Came in late though, so a lot is still messy. Go programmers! :D
[u]Dooming the project[/u] - I probably delayed this project by like a month by trapping Lullaby devs in Umamusume
[u]Himejoshing out[/u] - Oh yeah I'm listin' everythin baby. Including those times I screamed when autofister and takomaton yuri pulled up in the TL
[/ul]
[/left]

If you actually read this, thank you for sitting through this all :)
ALSO APPRECIATE PROGRAMMERS MORE!!! YOU HAVE NO GOD DAMN IDEA HOW MUCH EFFORT WE PUT INTO THIS FOR YOU.

also heres my oshi list i love gigi murin and cecilia immergreen and ninomae ina'nis and dokibird and mint fantome, and theyre probably hidden everywhere in the files huehuehue [img=64x64]res://assets/menus/console/credits/customemojis/Emote-gigi14.png[/img]"
socials_link = "https://twitter.com/anniebuue"
