description = "“Hello bro”

Happy Bunnies Member.

[u]     Art      [/u]

Pause art, promo art, Youtube Thumbnails, Album covers, \"Hypnosis\" font, Cartridge Art, Collector Portrait, Cartridge Case screen corner embelishments. 

[u]Safety Lullaby[/u]
Intro Cutscene Backgrounds, Rendered Ending Sprites, Hypnosis Overlay, Rendered Pendulum.

[u]Monochrome[/u]
Intro Storyboard + Rendered Art, Mid-Cutscene Storyboard, Mid-Cutscene Animation, Jumpscare Animations, Game Over Screens, Unown King Eye, Phase 1 Sprite Concepts, Healthbar Asset + Animations.

[u]Chimera[/u] 
Assist. Writing, storyboarding, Serena arm break anim, Serena Artstyle Transition rendered animation, Serena fallen down idle, reaching door anim, 2D backgrounds, Hex family portraits, game over art & animation, final gameover cleanup & storyboard & background, ending running cutscene, crawling animation, heartbeat animation, Chimera concept art/animations."
