[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_krns4"]
script = ExtResource("41")
name = "BreezyMelee"
role = "Programmer & Visual Enthusiast"
description = "\"TIME TO SAVE THE MOD heh....!.[img=64x64]res://assets/menus/console/credits/customemojis/GorillaDog.png[/img]\".

[u]Cabinet of Novelties Shop[/u]

[u]Layout[/u]
[ul]
[u]Scene[/u] - Shop Intro sequence implementation, camera movement, Collector \"splash\" text, lowering audio when focusing on area, final voicelines and outro implemented, intro fix, token dialogue fixed, intro skipping fix, cartridge cost implemented, register glow functionality, added jar sounds and focus, grey out training assets, Kollectadex music, enter lines, intro camera positions and rotations, fix console volumes.
[u]Logic[/u] - I made the entire dialogue system & the state of what the player is at.
[/ul]

[u]Monochrome[/u]

[u]Layout[/u]
[ul]
[u]Scene[/u] - Most of Monochrome finalization and added visual flare, timed blur and song-accurate jumpscares
[u]Cutscene's[/u] - Implemented missing intro cutscene assets, Expanded Mid Song / Blood Cutscene.
[u]Characters[/u] - Imported Gold's intro animation, Blood sprites & gunk.
[u]Shaders[/u] - Note blood blend shader. Unown's Peeper's shader (Background Unown's peeking at you).
[/ul]

[u]Typing Challenge[/u]
[ul]
[u]Graphics[/u] - Fixed up visual bugs & tweaked letter glow & Background darkening.
[u]Logic[/u] - Revamped a little bit of the mechanic, added space support for readability.
[/ul]

[u]Chimera[/u]

[u]Layout[/u]
[ul]
[u]Scene[/u] - Added part of the lighting, most of scene sequences implemented, light fixing, Added retouched gameover steps, Light flickers, fixed special animations functionality and flickering, black bars on intro fix, added overall sounds and ending assets, special animatino flickers, pry animations and camera added.
[u]Shaders[/u] - Perdition's NTSC Shader for visual cohesion and flair, Illuminating light from the roof.
[/ul]

[u]Heartbeat Challenge[/u]
[ul]
[u]Graphics[/u] - Made lines move from the sides toward the heart
[u]Logic[/u] - Revamped mechanic, made sure the visuals are displayed correctly.
[/ul]

[u]Crawling Challenge[/u]
[ul]
[u]Graphics[/u] - Implemented key hold/spam indicators, missing punishment, prying SFX added.
[u]Logic[/u] - Made the mechanic from scratch, Made it so i'm able to change how many time's you have to crawl to reach the end so i could've been so evil..... I did everything for this.
[/ul]

[u]Game-wide[/u]
[ul]
[u]Save Data[/u] - Made the basis for the save data system, made the Get/Set Flag system, The saving while Anniebuue revamped a bit of it. Like what she said, goodluck decoding it LMAO. 
[/ul]

[u]Miscellaneous[/u]
[ul]
[u]Baby Beef[/u] - I had to substitute for Anniebuue whenever she wasn't around, Baby Beef was.... *shivers*.
[u]Doordash[/u] - They paid me in schmeckles & doordash just to keep me motivated #Doordash #COOKED.
[u]Sacrifice[/u] - I sacrificed part of my health (in my own volition) just to get this out. Sleepless night's, 24+ Hrs work VCs. (longest record as im typing this is like 130  hours).
[/ul]

[u]NOTE[/u]
Play PERDITION: Episode #1 whenever that come's out because i'm pouring my heart and soul onto it. (Thank's to the people sticking by me with that project since it's been hard working on mostly everything sprite wise & programming wise by myself. I love you!)"
socials_link = "https://x.com/BreezyMelee"
